00:09:15.908 --> 00:09:18.043
<v Host>Two hundred kilograms.

00:09:18.644 --> 00:09:22.940
<v Host>That's all for today. Thanks for listening, and see you tomorrow.

00:09:23.539 --> 00:09:25.940
<v News>また明日。
